  "text": "9:41¢ ull § @\n< google sheets\nread, analyze, and update\nyour spreadsheets\nconnect google sheets to claude to read, analyze,\nand update your spreadsheets. claude can look up\nvalues, summarize and analyze your data, update cells,\nwrite formulas, add rows, columns, and tabs, and build\ncharts, filters, and formatting. useful for analyzing\nsurvey results, keeping trackers and planning sheets\nup to date, pulling numbers into reports, or asking\nquestions about your data in plain language. claude\nworks on spreadsheets you link to. connect google\ndrive as well to find spreadsheets by name or create\nnew ones.\ntools 6\nget_spreadsheet  get_values insert_dimension\nupdate_formulas  update_spreadsheet  update_values\n\ndetails\nauthor\ngoogle [7\nconnector url\nhttps://sheetsmcp.googleapis.com/mcp/v1 [hh\nmore info\ndocumentation [4\nsupport [4\nprivacy policy [4\n",
